# UI Telemetry Kernel (locked)

Docs: `docs/TELEMETRY.md` · Overtake: `docs/OVERTAKE_ELEMENT_PLUS.md` §企业基建 · package: `packages/telemetry`

## Slogan alignment
Exclusive enterprise track vs Element Plus (EP has no interaction telemetry contract).

## Principles
- **Default off** (`enabled: false`) — apps must opt in via `TelemetryService.configure` / `enable()` / `VpTelemetryProvider`.
- **Side-path only**: call `trackEmit({…})` beside business `emit`; never replace or break emit APIs.
- Telemetry failures **must not** throw into UI / change control flow.
- No hardcoded cloud dashboard, session recording, or heatmaps in the library. Sinks are pluggable (`consoleSink` / `bufferSink` / `customSink`).
- Tree-shake friendly: early return when disabled.

## Package & alias
- Import from `@amg-webui/telemetry` (vite / tsconfig alias like other `@amg-webui/*` packages).
- Hook: `useTrackedEmit` from `@amg-webui/hooks`.
- Provider: `TelemetryProvider` (`vp-telemetry-provider`) under `packages/components/base/TelemetryProvider/`.

## Component wiring
- Props (via `BaseProps`): `trackId?` · `telemetry?: boolean` (`false` forces skip). Components **must** `withDefaults(..., { telemetry: undefined })` — Vue casts omitted Booleans to `false`.
- First-wave interactive: Button · Link · Tag · Badge · Avatar · AvatarGroup · Card · FloatButton · Collapse · CopyText · Progress · Statistic · Ellipsis · CardWidgets.
- Skip presentational: Divider · Space · Skeleton · Spin · Highlight · Empty · Icon · ButtonGroup.

## Play / docs
- Example debug only: `example/pages/lab/TelemetryLabPage.vue` · route `lab-telemetry` · `meta.group: 'lab'`.
- Never ship example / cloud BI as the library surface.

## When extending
- Wire new interactive emits with `trackEmit` + `trackId` / `telemetry` props.
- Keep redact keys + ring buffer; extend `analyze.ts` for new alert kinds.
- Sync `TELEMETRY.md` + this rule when changing the contract.
